<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:17.030" end="00:00:19.050" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.440" end="00:00:33.460" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.280" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The tower grows, my chief.</p>
<p begin="00:00:46.160" end="00:00:50.000" style="s2">The quarry can barely feed it.</p>
<p begin="00:00:51.280" end="00:00:55.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then find more hands.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.440" end="00:00:58.480" style="s2">When it is finished,</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.120" end="00:01:00.840" style="s2">no sky will be free.</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.480" end="00:01:00.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:01:24.080" end="00:01:28.280" style="s2">Carry our stones.</p>
<p begin="00:01:25.960" end="00:01:28.280" style="s2">Okay.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.680" end="00:02:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The white one broke free.</p>
<p begin="00:02:15.840" end="00:02:20.560" style="s2">We followed her north beyond the sea.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.000" end="00:02:23.200" style="s2">She was wounded when we lost her in the</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.560" end="00:02:23.200" style="s2">forest.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.920" end="00:02:27.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you returned without her.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.640" end="00:02:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I brought you her trail.</p>
<p begin="00:02:30.720" end="00:02:34.000" style="s2">She cannot have gone far.</p>
<p begin="00:02:38.760" end="00:02:43.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She carried the future of my army.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.520" end="00:02:49.160" style="s2">Launch the boats.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.360" end="00:02:51.360" style="s2">Bring me every hand that can carry</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.160" end="00:02:53.360" style="s2">stone.</p>
<p begin="00:02:51.360" end="00:02:55.400" style="s2">And you,</p>
<p begin="00:02:53.360" end="00:02:57.400" style="s2">take your riders,</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.400" end="00:03:01.320" style="s2">find the white one,</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.400" end="00:03:01.320" style="s2">and bring me what she carries.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.987" end="00:03:10.007" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:03:56.457" end="00:03:58.477" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.387" end="00:04:02.407" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.273" end="00:04:46.293" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.280" end="00:07:41.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freyja, slow down. Sit.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.520" end="00:07:41.280" style="s2">Eat something.</p>
<p begin="00:07:42.080" end="00:07:44.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m eating.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.660" end="00:08:46.681" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.120" end="00:09:01.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where&#39;s she off to at this hour?</p>
<p begin="00:09:00.480" end="00:09:03.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The woods.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.680" end="00:09:06.276" style="s2">Her stupid wooden sword.</p>
<p begin="00:09:03.760" end="00:09:08.120" style="s2">She still thinks she&#39;ll be a warrior.</p>
<p begin="00:09:06.276" end="00:09:11.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:09:08.120" end="00:09:11.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That girl should have been a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:09:12.120" end="00:09:15.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s your daughter, Halward.</p>
<p begin="00:09:35.751" end="00:09:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:09:37.720" end="00:09:40.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will never be as good</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.956" end="00:09:44.976" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.226" end="00:10:07.901" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:10:05.881" end="00:10:07.901" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.680" end="00:10:17.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I will never be as good as the boys.</p>
<p begin="00:10:51.077" end="00:10:53.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:10:59.592" end="00:11:01.612" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:11:08.762" end="00:11:10.782" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.120" end="00:11:57.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I definitely should not do this.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.560" end="00:13:30.954" style="s2">Shh.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.934" end="00:13:30.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:14:15.840" end="00:14:17.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freya.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.749" end="00:14:19.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:14:17.560" end="00:14:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.040" end="00:14:20.680" style="s2">Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:14:19.720" end="00:14:21.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.680" end="00:14:24.680" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.880" end="00:14:25.680" style="s2">Below the ridge, there&#39;s a dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:14:24.680" end="00:14:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A dragon?</p>
<p begin="00:14:25.680" end="00:14:31.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White scales, wings bigger than this</p>
<p begin="00:14:27.760" end="00:14:31.680" style="s2">boat. It brought the trees down.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.320" end="00:14:38.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You frightened yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:14:36.440" end="00:14:40.640" style="s2">Snow on a fallen pine can look like</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.120" end="00:14:40.640" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:14:41.120" end="00:14:45.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know what a tree looks like.</p>
<p begin="00:14:43.360" end="00:14:48.080" style="s2">This was breathing.</p>
<p begin="00:14:45.040" end="00:14:48.080" style="s2">It couldn&#39;t stand.</p>
<p begin="00:14:49.360" end="00:14:52.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:14:51.000" end="00:14:53.360" style="s2">Go home.</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.360" end="00:14:55.800" style="s2">We&#39;ll talk when you&#39;ve caught your</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.360" end="00:14:55.800" style="s2">breath.</p>
<p begin="00:15:17.640" end="00:15:23.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watching won&#39;t earn you a place.</p>
<p begin="00:15:20.440" end="00:15:27.160" style="s2">Neither will keeping everyone else out.</p>
<p begin="00:15:23.200" end="00:15:27.160" style="s2">That&#39;s enough practice. Put them away.</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.000" end="00:15:44.640" style="s2">Where are you running, little warrior?</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.520" end="00:15:47.680" style="s2">Move.</p>
<p begin="00:15:44.640" end="00:15:47.680" style="s2">I&#39;m not in the mood.</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.960" end="00:15:57.640" style="s2">Careful.</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.200" end="00:15:57.640" style="s2">She&#39;s brought her wooden sword.</p>
<p begin="00:16:00.880" end="00:16:04.680" style="s2">Carrying that doesn&#39;t make you one of</p>
<p begin="00:16:02.280" end="00:16:04.680" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="00:16:06.640" end="00:16:10.440" style="s2">Pushing me doesn&#39;t make you a warrior,</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.000" end="00:16:10.440" style="s2">either.</p>
<p begin="00:16:16.040" end="00:16:19.080" style="s2">What frightened you, then?</p>
<p begin="00:16:20.320" end="00:16:23.120" style="s2">A dragon</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.640" end="00:16:26.040" style="s2">in the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.120" end="00:16:27.120" style="s2">Laugh if you like. A dragon? With that</p>
<p begin="00:16:26.040" end="00:16:28.280" style="s2">sword?</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.120" end="00:16:31.120" style="s2">Signe,</p>
<p begin="00:16:28.280" end="00:16:31.120" style="s2">let her past.</p>
<p begin="00:17:03.440" end="00:17:08.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Winter has taken enough from us.</p>
<p begin="00:17:05.959" end="00:17:10.240" style="s2">When the fjord opens, our hulls must be</p>
<p begin="00:17:08.000" end="00:17:12.280" style="s2">sound and our sails ready.</p>
<p begin="00:17:10.240" end="00:17:16.560" style="s2">Count the grain. Mend what can be</p>
<p begin="00:17:12.280" end="00:17:16.560" style="s2">mended. Halvard, how many boats?</p>
<p begin="00:17:18.600" end="00:17:23.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three ready.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.199" end="00:17:23.280" style="s2">Two still need work.</p>
<p begin="00:17:23.959" end="00:17:27.240" style="s2">Then we begin with those.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.160" end="00:17:39.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perhaps we can leave the ships here.</p>
<p begin="00:17:37.800" end="00:17:41.822" style="s2">Freya&#39;s found us a dragon.</p>
<p begin="00:17:39.802" end="00:17:41.822" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:17:47.080" end="00:17:51.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Laugh if you want.</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.240" end="00:17:54.840" style="s2">It&#39;s still there.</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.240" end="00:17:54.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And did it ask you to be its rider?</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.120" end="00:18:00.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It could barely lift its head.</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.280" end="00:18:03.600" style="s2">Below the ridge.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.280" end="00:18:03.600" style="s2">Broken trees everywhere.</p>
<p begin="00:18:05.040" end="00:18:12.320" style="s2">I came back because it needs help.</p>
<p begin="00:18:08.760" end="00:18:14.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or because you wanted us looking at you.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.320" end="00:18:16.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.280" end="00:18:20.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough from everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.480" end="00:18:20.040" style="s2">Freya, sit down.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.600" end="00:19:14.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They didn&#39;t even let me finish.</p>
<p begin="00:19:12.200" end="00:19:16.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then finish now. I&#39;m listening.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.720" end="00:19:20.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It wasn&#39;t chasing me.</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.440" end="00:19:20.560" style="s2">It was hurt. I think it was dying.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.600" end="00:19:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come home.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.000" end="00:19:25.840" style="s2">Tell me properly.</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.000" end="00:19:32.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The seams need 3 more days.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.680" end="00:19:34.480" style="s2">We&#39;ll have the boats ready before the</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.040" end="00:19:34.480" style="s2">thaw.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.120" end="00:19:42.960" style="s2">Sound boats have rotted.</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.000" end="00:19:44.908" style="s2">I&#39;d rather wait than lose men to rotten</p>
<p begin="00:19:42.960" end="00:19:46.928" style="s2">timber.</p>
<p begin="00:19:44.908" end="00:19:46.928" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.280" end="00:20:14.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You laughed before I&#39;d even finished.</p>
<p begin="00:20:12.440" end="00:20:16.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I laughed at the story.</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.440" end="00:20:18.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It didn&#39;t feel different.</p>
<p begin="00:20:16.560" end="00:20:20.640" style="s2">Why tell stories about dragons if</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.120" end="00:20:23.480" style="s2">they&#39;re impossible?</p>
<p begin="00:20:20.640" end="00:20:25.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because my father told them to me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:23.480" end="00:20:29.560" style="s2">Riders, he called them.</p>
<p begin="00:20:25.840" end="00:20:29.560" style="s2">Men and women carried into battle.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.520" end="00:20:36.600" style="s2">They fought beside our people when the</p>
<p begin="00:20:34.120" end="00:20:39.600" style="s2">old enemy came.</p>
<p begin="00:20:36.600" end="00:20:42.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who was allowed to ride them?</p>
<p begin="00:20:39.600" end="00:20:43.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No king could grant that.</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.080" end="00:20:46.520" style="s2">They said the dragons chose someone they</p>
<p begin="00:20:43.800" end="00:20:46.520" style="s2">trusted.</p>
<p begin="00:20:48.960" end="00:20:52.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When did they disappear?</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.640" end="00:20:58.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father said the last was seen when he</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.080" end="00:20:58.800" style="s2">was a boy.</p>
<p begin="00:21:04.040" end="00:21:07.400" style="s2">Your grandfather made this.</p>
<p begin="00:21:11.680" end="00:21:15.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You kept [music] it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:13.880" end="00:21:17.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course I kept it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.880" end="00:21:19.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But you don&#39;t believe his stories.</p>
<p begin="00:21:17.400" end="00:21:20.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believed him.</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.000" end="00:21:22.640" style="s2">I never knew what to make of the</p>
<p begin="00:21:20.040" end="00:21:22.640" style="s2">stories.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.166" end="00:23:17.186" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:23:28.840" end="00:23:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:30.280" end="00:23:33.400" style="s2">I&#39;m only moving this.</p>
<p begin="00:23:37.360" end="00:23:40.920" style="s2">There.</p>
<p begin="00:23:38.400" end="00:23:40.920" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:23:45.951" end="00:23:47.971" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:08.920" end="00:24:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.320" end="00:24:15.360" style="s2">I&#39;m not going to hurt you.</p>
<p begin="00:24:12.320" end="00:24:15.360" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to move.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.840" end="00:24:40.000" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.480" end="00:24:40.000" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.000" end="00:24:54.240" style="s2">You&#39;re not going to hurt me.</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.072" end="00:24:56.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:24:54.240" end="00:24:56.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:03.320" end="00:25:05.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:25:05.960" end="00:25:08.840" style="s2">I didn&#39;t think so.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.720" end="00:25:23.280" style="s2">You haven&#39;t eaten in days, have you?</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.720" end="00:25:29.960" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring something.</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.440" end="00:25:33.920" style="s2">Stay here.</p>
<p begin="00:25:29.960" end="00:25:33.920" style="s2">Well, you can&#39;t go very far.</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.000" end="00:25:38.200" style="s2">I&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:25:35.520" end="00:25:38.200" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.640" end="00:26:06.600" style="s2">Who&#39;s there? Leave those alone.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.480" end="00:26:54.840" style="s2">I brought breakfast. It isn&#39;t much for</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.840" end="00:26:54.840" style="s2">someone your size.</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.558" end="00:26:58.578" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:27:02.453" end="00:27:04.840" style="s2">[laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.640" end="00:27:08.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s it.</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.840" end="00:27:08.400" style="s2">Easy. There&#39;s more.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.200" end="00:27:37.520" style="s2">Slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.760" end="00:27:40.120" style="s2">Slowly. There&#39;s no hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.520" end="00:27:40.120" style="s2">I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.000" end="00:27:57.080" style="s2">What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.200" end="00:27:57.080" style="s2">What are you hiding?</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.120" end="00:28:07.840" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.800" end="00:28:07.840" style="s2">I won&#39;t come closer.</p>
<p begin="00:28:23.400" end="00:28:27.920" style="s2">Eggs.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.240" end="00:28:27.920" style="s2">You&#39;re a mother.</p>
<p begin="00:28:30.960" end="00:28:35.080" style="s2">That&#39;s why you wouldn&#39;t leave.</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.200" end="00:28:37.680" style="s2">I won&#39;t touch them.</p>
<p begin="00:28:35.080" end="00:28:40.920" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="00:28:37.680" end="00:28:40.920" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring more food tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.520" end="00:28:55.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You missed supper again.</p>
<p begin="00:28:52.520" end="00:28:55.720" style="s2">Your mother saved you some.</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.240" end="00:29:01.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wasn&#39;t hungry. [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="00:29:03.560" end="00:29:07.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then warm your hands at least.</p>
<p begin="00:29:16.600" end="00:29:21.960" style="s2">Liv says someone stole a basket of fish</p>
<p begin="00:29:19.200" end="00:29:21.960" style="s2">from the racks.</p>
<p begin="00:29:22.920" end="00:29:25.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe a fox.</p>
<p begin="00:29:25.900" end="00:29:30.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.680" end="00:29:30.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fox that carries baskets.</p>
<p begin="00:29:32.400" end="00:29:37.000" style="s2">Freya,</p>
<p begin="00:29:34.840" end="00:29:40.840" style="s2">whatever you&#39;re doing out there, the</p>
<p begin="00:29:37.000" end="00:29:40.840" style="s2">forest isn&#39;t safe in winter.</p>
<p begin="00:29:44.200" end="00:29:48.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you still believe grandfather&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.520" end="00:29:48.120" style="s2">stories?</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.560" end="00:29:51.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I believe he believed them.</p>
<p begin="00:29:52.360" end="00:29:55.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if one of them was true?</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.400" end="00:30:03.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I&#39;d want to know before it hurt</p>
<p begin="00:30:01.880" end="00:30:05.800" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.360" end="00:30:07.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not a child.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.800" end="00:30:10.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.240" end="00:30:10.320" style="s2">That&#39;s what frightens me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:00.876" end="00:31:02.896" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:31:16.480" end="00:31:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good morning to you, too.</p>
<p begin="00:31:21.280" end="00:31:25.640" style="s2">You remembered the basket before you</p>
<p begin="00:31:22.800" end="00:31:25.640" style="s2">remembered me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.720" end="00:31:55.600" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.240" end="00:31:55.600" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to prove anything.</p>
<p begin="00:32:01.680" end="00:32:04.412" style="s2">Look at you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:03.200" end="00:32:06.432" style="s2">You&#39;re walking.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.412" end="00:32:06.432" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.920" end="00:32:15.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The boys say I&#39;ll never be a warrior.</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.480" end="00:32:15.160" style="s2">My mother says I should mend nets.</p>
<p begin="00:32:21.200" end="00:32:24.120" style="s2">Maybe they&#39;re right.</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.920" end="00:32:32.360" style="s2">You don&#39;t think so, either, do you?</p>
<p begin="00:33:27.960" end="00:33:31.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:33:29.640" end="00:33:33.120" style="s2">You protected me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.720" end="00:33:36.200" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.120" end="00:33:36.200" style="s2">Back to your little ones.</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.120" end="00:34:13.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the Eastern Channel clears, we sail</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.840" end="00:34:17.120" style="s2">in 3 days.</p>
<p begin="00:34:13.639" end="00:34:21.320" style="s2">Two crews to each boat. Grain, rope,</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.120" end="00:34:21.320" style="s2">spare oars before noon.</p>
<p begin="00:34:21.399" end="00:34:25.679" style="s2">Halvard,</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.000" end="00:34:27.800" style="s2">will the hulls hold?</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.679" end="00:34:31.000" style="s2">Every seam, chief.</p>
<p begin="00:34:27.800" end="00:34:31.000" style="s2">If the sea allows it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.280" end="00:34:34.919" style="s2">Then we&#39;d better be ready.</p>
<p begin="00:34:32.679" end="00:34:34.919" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah!</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.473" end="00:34:51.493" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.160" end="00:36:08.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wester, Thor is awake. They&#39;re tipping</p>
<p begin="00:36:05.400" end="00:36:08.200" style="s2">my orders.</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.440" end="00:36:16.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ships.</p>
<p begin="00:36:16.120" end="00:36:21.440" style="s2">Black ships from the south.</p>
<p begin="00:36:18.920" end="00:36:24.800" style="s2">Beasts that walk like men.</p>
<p begin="00:36:21.440" end="00:36:24.800" style="s2">They are coming for us.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.040" end="00:36:33.360" style="s2">Don&#39;t send our boats away.</p>
<p begin="00:36:30.440" end="00:36:33.360" style="s2">Listen to me.</p>
<p begin="00:36:39.515" end="00:36:41.535" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:36:42.920" end="00:36:46.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We must arm</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.120" end="00:36:49.600" style="s2">every man,</p>
<p begin="00:36:46.680" end="00:36:51.600" style="s2">every shield maiden.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.600" end="00:36:54.120" style="s2">Hide the children inland above the</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.600" end="00:36:54.120" style="s2">water.</p>
<p begin="00:36:55.360" end="00:36:59.960" style="s2">Put eyes on the southern shore before</p>
<p begin="00:36:57.160" end="00:36:59.960" style="s2">sunrise.</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.360" end="00:37:03.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.160" end="00:37:12.080" style="s2">No ship has crossed that passage all</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.520" end="00:37:13.880" style="s2">winter.</p>
<p begin="00:37:12.080" end="00:37:16.360" style="s2">I will not empty this village on a</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.880" end="00:37:18.840" style="s2">dream.</p>
<p begin="00:37:16.360" end="00:37:22.000" style="s2">We keep the watch.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.840" end="00:37:22.000" style="s2">We keep our heads.</p>
<p begin="00:37:22.745" end="00:37:26.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="00:37:24.600" end="00:37:29.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lauf,</p>
<p begin="00:37:26.280" end="00:37:30.680" style="s2">the sea will not care.</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.160" end="00:37:33.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father,</p>
<p begin="00:37:30.680" end="00:37:33.640" style="s2">what if she&#39;s right?</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.920" end="00:37:49.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go home, Freya.</p>
<p begin="00:37:46.520" end="00:37:52.200" style="s2">Bolt the door behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.480" end="00:37:52.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You heard her.</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.520" end="00:37:58.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard.</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.000" end="00:37:58.600" style="s2">I&#39;ll look at the watch before I sleep.</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.440" end="00:38:15.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey!</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.520" end="00:39:49.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The village is beyond the forest.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.120" end="00:39:51.360" style="s2">Take them alive. Everyone.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.160" end="00:39:53.600" style="s2">My ride is hurt. The white one.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.360" end="00:39:53.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; White!</p>
<p begin="00:40:52.640" end="00:40:55.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay down.</p>
<p begin="00:41:14.960" end="00:41:17.080" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:42:14.280" end="00:42:16.400" style="s2">Ah!</p>
<p begin="00:42:23.880" end="00:42:27.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.800" end="00:42:29.344" style="s2">That&#39;s the village.</p>
<p begin="00:42:27.324" end="00:42:29.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.319" end="00:42:48.720" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:42:47.240" end="00:42:51.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay with them.</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.720" end="00:42:51.560" style="s2">Keep them safe.</p>
<p begin="00:42:57.680" end="00:43:00.440" style="s2">I&#39;ll come back.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.240" end="00:43:30.260" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.680" end="00:44:13.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:44:10.240" end="00:44:13.120" style="s2">Keep the way clear.</p>
<p begin="00:44:18.800" end="00:44:23.880" style="s2">You know this village.</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.800" end="00:44:23.880" style="s2">Look after one another.</p>
<p begin="00:45:14.040" end="00:45:15.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bjorn,</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.006" end="00:45:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:45:15.120" end="00:45:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.760" end="00:45:26.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together.</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.960" end="00:45:26.800" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them through.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.760" end="00:45:37.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back to the corner. Stay together.</p>
<p begin="00:45:35.311" end="00:45:37.331" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="00:45:45.136" end="00:45:48.760" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:45:46.760" end="00:45:51.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her hand is numb. Her sword clamored on</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.760" end="00:45:51.200" style="s2">to do.</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.360" end="00:46:01.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Draw!</p>
<p begin="00:45:59.120" end="00:46:01.520" style="s2">Clench!</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.240" end="00:46:18.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; TO ME. [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.400" end="00:46:18.480" style="s2">FALL BACK TO ME.</p>
<p begin="00:46:20.200" end="00:46:22.472" style="s2">MOMENTARINESS.</p>
<p begin="00:46:21.817" end="00:46:24.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.472" end="00:46:24.492" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:46:34.400" end="00:46:38.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LOOK AT ME.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.520" end="00:46:38.847" style="s2">STAY TOGETHER.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.192" end="00:46:40.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.847" end="00:46:40.867" style="s2">[groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:46:50.480" end="00:46:54.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Up the hill. Keep going.</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.640" end="00:47:08.520" style="s2">Stay behind me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:22.120" end="00:47:27.440" style="s2">She&#39;s coming with me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:24.320" end="00:47:27.440" style="s2">Don&#39;t separate us.</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.658" end="00:47:47.678" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning and screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.960" end="00:47:58.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freyas.</p>
<p begin="00:47:55.040" end="00:47:58.560" style="s2">HAS ANYONE SEEN MY DAUGHTER?</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.160" end="00:48:33.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; KEEP this one alive.</p>
<p begin="00:49:11.400" end="00:49:14.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="00:49:15.080" end="00:49:19.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FREYJA, NO. STAY BACK.</p>
<p begin="00:49:24.000" end="00:49:29.400" style="s2">RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.440" end="00:49:29.400" style="s2">FREYJA, RUN.</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.960" end="00:49:59.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LEAVE [screaming] HER!</p>
<p begin="00:50:23.800" end="00:50:28.809" style="s2">VOICE OF ROHAN, DESPERATE. FREE HER!</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.789" end="00:50:28.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.320" end="00:50:43.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; WHERE IS SHE?</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.400" end="00:50:43.680" style="s2">HALBRAND, WHERE is Freya?</p>
<p begin="00:51:12.960" end="00:51:16.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The village is taken.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.800" end="00:51:19.400" style="s2">The prisoners are aboard.</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.720" end="00:51:22.000" style="s2">Some escaped into the hills.</p>
<p begin="00:51:19.400" end="00:51:23.880" style="s2">The white one is still out there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.000" end="00:51:26.800" style="s2">Recall the riders.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.880" end="00:51:26.800" style="s2">We hunt again.</p>
<p begin="00:53:19.240" end="00:53:21.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father?</p>
<p begin="00:53:26.916" end="00:53:28.936" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:53:33.120" end="00:53:35.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mother?</p>
<p begin="00:53:43.760" end="00:53:46.880" style="s2">Father?</p>
<p begin="00:53:44.920" end="00:53:49.520" style="s2">breathe slower.</p>
<p begin="00:53:46.880" end="00:53:49.520" style="s2">Leap.</p>
<p begin="00:54:21.800" end="00:54:24.640" style="s2">They took them.</p>
<p begin="00:54:25.120" end="00:54:27.240" style="s2">My family.</p>
<p begin="00:54:26.522" end="00:54:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:54:27.240" end="00:54:30.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know where they&#39;ve gone.</p>
<p begin="00:55:18.280" end="00:55:21.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Save your strength.</p>
<p begin="00:55:41.080" end="00:55:44.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at those channels.</p>
<p begin="00:55:45.160" end="00:55:47.840" style="s2">Drainage?</p>
<p begin="00:55:50.600" end="00:55:56.080" style="s2">They run uphill.</p>
<p begin="00:55:52.880" end="00:55:56.080" style="s2">This is no fortress.</p>
<p begin="00:55:58.200" end="00:56:03.480" style="s2">Whatever it is,</p>
<p begin="00:56:00.160" end="00:56:03.480" style="s2">it wasn&#39;t built for men.</p>
<p begin="00:56:09.800" end="00:56:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; More hands.</p>
<p begin="00:56:11.240" end="00:56:14.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put them on the upper works.</p>
<p begin="00:56:17.560" end="00:56:21.560" style="s2">Stone is not what we&#39;re missing.</p>
<p begin="00:56:27.800" end="00:56:30.960" style="s2">Where is the white one?</p>
<p begin="00:56:38.720" end="00:56:44.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We searched the ridges.</p>
<p begin="00:56:40.680" end="00:56:44.160" style="s2">She&#39;s keeping beneath the trees.</p>
<p begin="00:56:46.520" end="00:56:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then search beneath them.</p>
<p begin="00:56:48.800" end="00:56:52.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My riders are already returning.</p>
<p begin="00:56:55.040" end="00:56:59.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring me her eggs.</p>
<p begin="00:56:57.840" end="00:57:04.320" style="s2">Without them,</p>
<p begin="00:56:59.840" end="00:57:04.320" style="s2">all this stone is worthless.</p>
<p begin="00:57:09.960" end="00:57:14.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finish the tower.</p>
<p begin="00:57:11.880" end="00:57:16.800" style="s2">Bring me the eggs.</p>
<p begin="00:57:14.400" end="00:57:19.480" style="s2">Their blood will call to every dragon in</p>
<p begin="00:57:16.800" end="00:57:19.480" style="s2">the north.</p>
<p begin="00:57:19.920" end="00:57:23.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And they will obey.</p>
<p begin="00:57:24.200" end="00:57:27.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They will have no choice.</p>
<p begin="00:57:38.080" end="00:57:44.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Resonance deepens is now passable thrum.</p>
<p begin="00:57:55.470" end="00:57:57.490" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:58:10.800" end="00:58:16.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw her fall.</p>
<p begin="00:58:13.360" end="00:58:16.360" style="s2">I couldn&#39;t get to her.</p>
<p begin="00:58:18.080" end="00:58:21.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know that she&#39;s gone.</p>
<p begin="00:58:22.120" end="00:58:27.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If she&#39;s alive,</p>
<p begin="00:58:24.680" end="00:58:31.200" style="s2">I pray she stays away.</p>
<p begin="00:58:27.760" end="00:58:31.200" style="s2">Then we find our own way out.</p>
<p begin="00:58:55.730" end="00:58:57.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:59:22.280" end="00:59:25.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more wooden swords.</p>
<p begin="00:59:36.400" end="00:59:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ll come back. They know you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:59:38.040" end="00:59:40.440" style="s2">here.</p>
<p begin="00:59:46.360" end="00:59:49.360" style="s2">We have to move them.</p>
<p begin="01:00:01.886" end="01:00:04.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:00:02.541" end="01:00:04.561" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:00:08.240" end="01:00:13.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m going after my family.</p>
<p begin="01:00:10.920" end="01:00:17.160" style="s2">I don&#39;t know how far I&#39;ll have to go.</p>
<p begin="01:00:13.960" end="01:00:17.160" style="s2">I can&#39;t do this alone.</p>
<p begin="01:00:18.320" end="01:00:21.280" style="s2">Will you come with me?</p>
<p begin="01:00:33.440" end="01:00:36.200" style="s2">We&#39;ll find them.</p>
<p begin="01:01:15.000" end="01:01:20.120" style="s2">He said the riders flew with them.</p>
<p begin="01:01:18.320" end="01:01:23.080" style="s2">Maybe one day</p>
<p begin="01:01:20.120" end="01:01:23.080" style="s2">you&#39;ll fly again.</p>
<p begin="01:01:38.840" end="01:01:41.880" style="s2">They will see the fire.</p>
<p begin="01:01:55.040" end="01:01:57.760" style="s2">Rest.</p>
<p begin="01:02:13.360" end="01:02:18.920" style="s2">Look at that.</p>
<p begin="01:02:16.000" end="01:02:18.920" style="s2">A little better.</p>
<p begin="01:02:24.600" end="01:02:28.840" style="s2">Yes, very impressive. Thank you.</p>
<p begin="01:02:37.200" end="01:02:40.800" style="s2">Through the trees.</p>
<p begin="01:02:39.120" end="01:02:43.120" style="s2">We&#39;ve given them enough chances to see</p>
<p begin="01:02:40.800" end="01:02:43.120" style="s2">us.</p>
<p begin="01:02:54.720" end="01:02:59.080" style="s2">That helps.</p>
<p begin="01:02:56.120" end="01:02:59.080" style="s2">Keep doing that.</p>
<p begin="01:03:02.800" end="01:03:06.600" style="s2">Don&#39;t move. Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="01:03:19.640" end="01:03:22.720" style="s2">They can closer.</p>
<p begin="01:03:40.800" end="01:03:43.240" style="s2">For me?</p>
<p begin="01:03:46.320" end="01:03:50.160" style="s2">You could have started doing this days</p>
<p begin="01:03:47.680" end="01:03:50.160" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="01:04:07.960" end="01:04:12.809" style="s2">Father built boats with this.</p>
<p begin="01:04:10.789" end="01:04:12.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:04:16.680" end="01:04:19.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now it keeps us alive.</p>
<p begin="01:04:29.960" end="01:04:34.000" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="01:04:31.280" end="01:04:34.000" style="s2">Do that again.</p>
<p begin="01:04:36.240" end="01:04:39.200" style="s2">There&#39;s someone in there.</p>
<p begin="01:05:06.200" end="01:05:11.000" style="s2">Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:05:07.800" end="01:05:14.400" style="s2">You don&#39;t have to prove anything.</p>
<p begin="01:05:11.000" end="01:05:14.400" style="s2">We&#39;ll try again when you&#39;re ready.</p>
<p begin="01:05:25.880" end="01:05:32.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drazeck is still on the mainland.</p>
<p begin="01:05:28.680" end="01:05:32.200" style="s2">Send him beneath the trees.</p>
<p begin="01:05:33.360" end="01:05:37.280" style="s2">I want those eggs unbroken.</p>
<p begin="01:05:41.360" end="01:05:44.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the girl?</p>
<p begin="01:05:44.200" end="01:05:47.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Bring her, too.</p>
<p begin="01:05:55.160" end="01:06:00.760" style="s2">Now, find the white one.</p>
<p begin="01:05:58.080" end="01:06:00.760" style="s2">Workers.</p>
<p begin="01:06:02.080" end="01:06:07.440" style="s2">Keep your riders above the forest.</p>
<p begin="01:06:04.320" end="01:06:07.440" style="s2">We&#39;ll search beneath it.</p>
<p begin="01:06:08.035" end="01:06:10.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting]</p>
<p begin="01:06:24.410" end="01:06:26.430" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="01:06:35.800" end="01:06:40.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She buried her fire.</p>
<p begin="01:06:38.040" end="01:06:40.840" style="s2">Clever girl.</p>
<p begin="01:06:41.920" end="01:06:45.320" style="s2">Find where she left the trail.</p>
<p begin="01:07:00.520" end="01:07:05.480" style="s2">The heavy tracks. Follow them. Go!</p>
<p begin="01:07:21.320" end="01:07:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just something to hold. No pulling you</p>
<p begin="01:07:23.400" end="01:07:26.000" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="01:07:33.841" end="01:07:35.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:07:52.840" end="01:07:59.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her bloodline can wake the tower.</p>
<p begin="01:07:55.880" end="01:07:59.160" style="s2">Our dragons cannot.</p>
<p begin="01:08:00.200" end="01:08:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Five young dragons.</p>
<p begin="01:08:02.280" end="01:08:05.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the others obey.</p>
<p begin="01:08:06.520" end="01:08:11.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we bring them here,</p>
<p begin="01:08:08.360" end="01:08:11.240" style="s2">all five,</p>
<p begin="01:08:24.839" end="01:08:30.279" style="s2">&gt;&gt; bring the brood here,</p>
<p begin="01:08:27.040" end="01:08:32.640" style="s2">then the north belongs to us.</p>
<p begin="01:08:30.279" end="01:08:36.319" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can feel their bloodline.</p>
<p begin="01:08:32.640" end="01:08:36.319" style="s2">I cannot show you a path.</p>
<p begin="01:08:38.359" end="01:08:41.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then our hunters will.</p>
<p begin="01:08:41.962" end="01:08:43.982" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:08:53.759" end="01:08:57.480" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay down. Let me look.</p>
<p begin="01:09:05.720" end="01:09:08.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s no wolf.</p>
<p begin="01:09:18.680" end="01:09:23.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our prisoners reached Ashfall alive.</p>
<p begin="01:09:21.960" end="01:09:26.560" style="s2">Find the white one</p>
<p begin="01:09:23.680" end="01:09:26.560" style="s2">and we follow.</p>
<p begin="01:09:26.839" end="01:09:29.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Alive?</p>
<p begin="01:09:48.118" end="01:09:50.138" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:09:58.720" end="01:10:04.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fewer every morning.</p>
<p begin="01:10:00.760" end="01:10:04.120" style="s2">Keep the rest working.</p>
<p begin="01:10:13.680" end="01:10:19.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The white dragon they hunt,</p>
<p begin="01:10:15.760" end="01:10:19.800" style="s2">Freya saw it. We laughed.</p>
<p begin="01:10:21.720" end="01:10:25.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then she may still be out there.</p>
<p begin="01:10:26.080" end="01:10:29.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gods keep her hidden.</p>
<p begin="01:10:27.418" end="01:10:29.438" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:11:09.880" end="01:11:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What? Please.</p>
<p begin="01:11:12.120" end="01:11:15.400" style="s2">No. No. No, Sefixed.</p>
<p begin="01:11:23.440" end="01:11:27.560" style="s2">They found you.</p>
<p begin="01:11:24.720" end="01:11:27.560" style="s2">We can&#39;t stay.</p>
<p begin="01:11:31.680" end="01:11:36.160" style="s2">They&#39;re alive.</p>
<p begin="01:11:33.000" end="01:11:36.160" style="s2">They took them to Ashfall.</p>
<p begin="01:11:39.640" end="01:11:41.600" style="s2">Two days since we tried.</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.434" end="01:11:42.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:41.600" end="01:11:45.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to know what your wing can</p>
<p begin="01:11:42.640" end="01:11:45.200" style="s2">manage.</p>
<p begin="01:11:49.294" end="01:11:52.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [bell]</p>
<p begin="01:11:50.604" end="01:11:52.624" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:11:58.080" end="01:12:02.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At the bell,</p>
<p begin="01:11:59.520" end="01:12:02.800" style="s2">they lose sight of this ramp.</p>
<p begin="01:12:05.680" end="01:12:10.240" style="s2">Only a few breaths. Then I won&#39;t waste</p>
<p begin="01:12:07.960" end="01:12:10.240" style="s2">them.</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.480" end="01:12:26.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move it!</p>
<p begin="01:12:23.920" end="01:12:26.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move it! Stop</p>
<p begin="01:12:54.795" end="01:12:56.815" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.725" end="01:13:00.745" style="s2">[screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:13:04.620" end="01:13:06.640" style="s2">[panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:13:09.040" end="01:13:12.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The little one still has teeth.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.400" end="01:13:32.000" style="s2">Freyja warned us.</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.200" end="01:13:35.960" style="s2">I laughed at her.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.000" end="01:13:35.960" style="s2">Then don&#39;t waste what&#39;s left on shame.</p>
<p begin="01:13:54.960" end="01:13:59.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All five</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.440" end="01:13:59.600" style="s2">warm and covered.</p>
<p begin="01:14:05.680" end="01:14:10.121" style="s2">One short flight.</p>
<p begin="01:14:07.320" end="01:14:12.141" style="s2">We come straight back.</p>
<p begin="01:14:10.121" end="01:14:12.141" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:14:30.600" end="01:14:34.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Around the ridge and back.</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.400" end="01:14:36.680" style="s2">If it hurts,</p>
<p begin="01:14:34.000" end="01:14:36.680" style="s2">we stop.</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.120" end="01:14:45.000" style="s2">All right.</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.400" end="01:14:45.000" style="s2">I&#39;m ready.</p>
<p begin="01:14:46.200" end="01:14:49.960" style="s2">Do you see?</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.480" end="01:14:49.960" style="s2">Do you see?</p>
<p begin="01:15:27.160" end="01:15:31.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who helped you?</p>
<p begin="01:15:30.040" end="01:15:33.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one.</p>
<p begin="01:15:31.342" end="01:15:33.362" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.880" end="01:15:40.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did.</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.160" end="01:15:48.280" style="s2">Upper stones.</p>
<p begin="01:15:44.760" end="01:15:48.280" style="s2">Keep him working through the night.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.040" end="01:15:53.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Father.</p>
<p begin="01:16:08.022" end="01:16:10.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:16:22.400" end="01:16:26.280" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The white bloodline is stirring.</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.280" end="01:16:33.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you find her?</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.000" end="01:16:36.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not from this.</p>
<p begin="01:16:33.840" end="01:16:36.960" style="s2">The hunters must.</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.240" end="01:16:51.680" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Above the ridge, SOUND THE HORN.</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.280" end="01:17:05.360" style="s2">Round the gorge, keep moving.</p>
<p begin="01:17:06.318" end="01:17:08.338" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:17:18.108" end="01:17:20.600" style="s2">[sighs]</p>
<p begin="01:17:19.160" end="01:17:21.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; All right.</p>
<p begin="01:17:20.600" end="01:17:24.560" style="s2">Your way.</p>
<p begin="01:17:21.960" end="01:17:24.560" style="s2">I&#39;ll follow.</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.520" end="01:17:30.040" style="s2">There. That&#39;s better.</p>
<p begin="01:17:39.068" end="01:17:41.088" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.280" end="01:18:17.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Easy.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.840" end="01:18:19.734" style="s2">We don&#39;t have to go far.</p>
<p begin="01:18:17.714" end="01:18:19.734" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [music]</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.040" end="01:18:28.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were right, grandfather.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.640" end="01:18:44.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You boats.</p>
<p begin="01:18:41.560" end="01:18:44.880" style="s2">Make yourself useful.</p>
<p begin="01:19:01.400" end="01:19:05.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s too narrow.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.720" end="01:19:05.560" style="s2">Not with that wing.</p>
<p begin="01:19:17.720" end="01:19:21.800" style="s2">Back to the lake. We&#39;ve gone far enough.</p>
<p begin="01:19:54.280" end="01:19:59.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay together now.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.960" end="01:19:59.360" style="s2">No more warnings for the girl.</p>
<p begin="01:20:21.800" end="01:20:25.760" style="s2">Get it up. We need every beast.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.480" end="01:20:30.760" style="s2">The riders will turn her back.</p>
<p begin="01:20:46.560" end="01:20:50.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:20:48.080" end="01:20:50.800" style="s2">You&#39;ve done it.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.720" end="01:21:00.680" style="s2">Let&#39;s go back before we ask too much.</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.016" end="01:21:10.036" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.640" end="01:21:20.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I nearly made it.</p>
<p begin="01:21:17.400" end="01:21:20.600" style="s2">Next time I won&#39;t stop.</p>
<p begin="01:21:21.080" end="01:21:24.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next time</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.400" end="01:21:27.520" style="s2">we plan it together.</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.160" end="01:21:27.520" style="s2">Nobody gets left behind.</p>
<p begin="01:21:36.640" end="01:21:42.440" style="s2">There, the lake.</p>
<p begin="01:21:38.520" end="01:21:42.440" style="s2">Our hiding place is beyond those pines.</p>
<p begin="01:21:52.840" end="01:21:57.160" style="s2">Almost home.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.200" end="01:21:57.160" style="s2">Then you can rest.</p>
<p begin="01:22:11.960" end="01:22:15.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep her above the forest.</p>
<p begin="01:22:19.440" end="01:22:25.200" style="s2">Spread out.</p>
<p begin="01:22:21.720" end="01:22:25.200" style="s2">Don&#39;t let her disappear again.</p>
<p begin="01:22:36.040" end="01:22:40.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ABOVE US.</p>
<p begin="01:22:37.520" end="01:22:40.040" style="s2">TURN.</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.760" end="01:22:52.160" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There she is.</p>
<p begin="01:22:49.160" end="01:22:52.160" style="s2">Close the gap.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.960" end="01:23:08.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me the brood, girl,</p>
<p begin="01:23:05.360" end="01:23:08.240" style="s2">and you live.</p>
<p begin="01:23:13.840" end="01:23:16.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ll never have them.</p>
<p begin="01:23:28.440" end="01:23:33.120" style="s2">Stay with me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:29.840" end="01:23:33.120" style="s2">Please, stay with me.</p>
<p begin="01:23:33.480" end="01:23:37.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep her turning.</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.000" end="01:23:37.880" style="s2">Wear her down.</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.080" end="01:23:58.960" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get away from her.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.248" end="01:24:04.268" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs and gasps]</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.680" end="01:24:07.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No more wooden swords.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.040" end="01:24:34.040" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.360" end="01:24:34.040" style="s2">Keep going.</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.040" end="01:24:47.000" style="s2">Stay low.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.400" end="01:24:47.000" style="s2">Stay low.</p>
<p begin="01:25:02.520" end="01:25:05.600" style="s2">It&#39;s still behind us.</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.760" end="01:25:31.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Focus, the rider. Take her.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.160" end="01:25:43.640" style="s2">HOLD HER.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.760" end="01:25:43.640" style="s2">HOLD HER.</p>
<p begin="01:25:45.360" end="01:25:48.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go of her.</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.600" end="01:26:24.080" style="s2">No!</p>
<p begin="01:26:20.840" end="01:26:24.080" style="s2">you didn&#39;t have to fail.</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.000" end="01:26:42.440" style="s2">The pines, there.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.320" end="01:26:53.840" style="s2">Please,</p>
<p begin="01:26:50.600" end="01:26:53.840" style="s2">just a little further.</p>
<p begin="01:27:09.560" end="01:27:12.920" style="s2">Cut off the lower path.</p>
<p begin="01:27:44.040" end="01:27:46.480" style="s2">Mother?</p>
<p begin="01:27:56.200" end="01:28:00.560" style="s2">No eggs,</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.760" end="01:28:00.560" style="s2">she&#39;s hidden them.</p>
<p begin="01:28:06.880" end="01:28:12.200" style="s2">Keep back.</p>
<p begin="01:28:08.160" end="01:28:12.200" style="s2">We return with Drazak at first light.</p>
<p begin="01:28:29.480" end="01:28:33.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The white one is dying.</p>
<p begin="01:28:31.640" end="01:28:35.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the brood?</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.440" end="01:28:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still sleeping.</p>
<p begin="01:28:35.440" end="01:28:38.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not for long.</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.246" end="01:28:45.266" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [cough]</p>
<p begin="01:28:49.141" end="01:28:51.161" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:28:53.480" end="01:28:58.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.720" end="01:28:58.720" style="s2">Please, look at me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.680" end="01:29:08.320" style="s2">There you are.</p>
<p begin="01:29:33.440" end="01:29:37.680" style="s2">I&#39;m still here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.920" end="01:29:37.680" style="s2">We&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.600" end="01:29:55.360" style="s2">You saved me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:52.040" end="01:29:55.360" style="s2">You should have saved yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.227" end="01:30:03.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.600" end="01:30:03.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still looking after me.</p>
<p begin="01:30:08.720" end="01:30:12.640" style="s2">The first day I saw you,</p>
<p begin="01:30:10.960" end="01:30:15.840" style="s2">I ran.</p>
<p begin="01:30:12.640" end="01:30:15.840" style="s2">I was so scared.</p>
<p begin="01:30:16.912" end="01:30:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:30:18.600" end="01:30:21.560" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Look at us now.</p>
<p begin="01:30:28.920" end="01:30:31.920" style="s2">I&#39;ll bring them to you.</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.760" end="01:30:46.800" style="s2">All five. They&#39;re safe.</p>
<p begin="01:30:57.720" end="01:31:02.000" style="s2">Look.</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.040" end="01:31:02.000" style="s2">I brought them to you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:06.160" end="01:31:09.360" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="01:31:07.640" end="01:31:12.240" style="s2">Just stand.</p>
<p begin="01:31:09.360" end="01:31:12.240" style="s2">We can hide you.</p>
<p begin="01:31:23.720" end="01:31:26.343" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="01:31:24.760" end="01:31:28.363" style="s2">One more time.</p>
<p begin="01:31:26.343" end="01:31:28.363" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.120" end="01:31:55.880" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want them?</p>
<p begin="01:31:53.000" end="01:31:55.880" style="s2">Come and take them.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.600" end="01:32:04.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s finished, girl.</p>
<p begin="01:32:01.320" end="01:32:04.320" style="s2">Step aside.</p>
<p begin="01:32:08.640" end="01:32:11.080" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.560" end="01:32:39.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Back.</p>
<p begin="01:32:37.520" end="01:32:41.840" style="s2">Take the upper path. Seal it before</p>
<p begin="01:32:39.360" end="01:32:41.840" style="s2">dawn.</p>
<p begin="01:33:05.920" end="01:33:08.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.800" end="01:33:18.400" style="s2">For them.</p>
<p begin="01:33:27.680" end="01:33:33.320" style="s2">I&#39;ll take care of them.</p>
<p begin="01:33:30.000" end="01:33:33.320" style="s2">Like you took care of me.</p>
<p begin="01:33:43.600" end="01:33:48.120" style="s2">Stay.</p>
<p begin="01:33:44.960" end="01:33:48.120" style="s2">Just a little longer.</p>
<p begin="01:33:48.479" end="01:33:50.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [crying]</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.340" end="01:33:58.360" style="s2">[music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:09.440" end="01:34:14.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sleep now. You&#39;re free. No more hiding.</p>
<p begin="01:34:25.720" end="01:34:28.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope.</p>
<p begin="01:34:34.800" end="01:34:35.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Drink.</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.640" end="01:34:38.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:34:35.760" end="01:34:39.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Quickly.</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.360" end="01:34:42.360" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The bread.</p>
<p begin="01:34:39.800" end="01:34:45.640" style="s2">If they catch you.</p>
<p begin="01:34:42.360" end="01:34:45.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then eat before they look.</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.800" end="01:34:59.160" style="s2">The white dragon. [music]</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.080" end="01:34:59.160" style="s2">They say it&#39;s dying.</p>
<p begin="01:35:00.840" end="01:35:05.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freida found it first.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.280" end="01:35:07.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Her expedition crumbles for a moment.</p>
<p begin="01:35:05.520" end="01:35:10.240" style="s2">And I laughed at her.</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.240" end="01:35:10.240" style="s2">She tried to warn us.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.455" end="01:35:25.475" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.640" end="01:35:34.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Together.</p>
<p begin="01:35:32.120" end="01:35:34.800" style="s2">All of us.</p>
<p begin="01:35:47.036" end="01:35:51.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.200" end="01:35:51.640" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She flew, grandfather.</p>
<p begin="01:35:52.560" end="01:35:56.400" style="s2">She voice-filled flew with me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.360" end="01:36:17.680" style="s2">Oh.</p>
<p begin="01:36:14.800" end="01:36:17.680" style="s2">Oh gods.</p>
<p begin="01:36:45.880" end="01:36:50.520" style="s2">She&#39;s gone little one.</p>
<p begin="01:36:47.720" end="01:36:50.520" style="s2">But I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="01:37:04.982" end="01:37:07.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:37:08.640" end="01:37:11.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Okay.</p>
<p begin="01:37:13.520" end="01:37:17.520" style="s2">Easy.</p>
<p begin="01:37:14.600" end="01:37:17.520" style="s2">One at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:37:18.920" end="01:37:23.360" style="s2">Hello.</p>
<p begin="01:37:20.360" end="01:37:23.360" style="s2">Hello little ones.</p>
<p begin="01:37:31.440" end="01:37:36.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;ve hatched.</p>
<p begin="01:37:33.280" end="01:37:36.240" style="s2">All five.</p>
<p begin="01:37:36.800" end="01:37:42.000" style="s2">Bring them here.</p>
<p begin="01:37:38.280" end="01:37:42.000" style="s2">The hunters know their task.</p>
<p begin="01:37:46.320" end="01:37:48.920" style="s2">Freya.</p>
<p begin="01:37:50.000" end="01:37:54.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll keep them safe.</p>
<p begin="01:37:52.080" end="01:37:54.800" style="s2">I promise.</p>
<p begin="01:37:56.640" end="01:38:00.120" style="s2">And I&#39;ll bring my family home.</p>
<p begin="01:38:00.400" end="01:38:04.560" style="s2">Snow.</p>
<p begin="01:38:01.520" end="01:38:04.560" style="s2">That buys us time.</p>
<p begin="01:38:25.920" end="01:38:30.400" style="s2">Snow.</p>
<p begin="01:38:27.320" end="01:38:30.400" style="s2">That buys us time.</p>
